{"type":"message","id":"002c7f33","parentId":"55416eb0","timestamp":"2026-05-31T05:15:56.057Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - so the worker is running. The GET endpoints work (like /history) but POST /send returns error 1101 (500). This could mean the worker doesn't have a POST handler for /send, or there's a bug in the worker code.\n\nSince I can't successfully post messages (the POST endpoint seems broken), let me report what I found:\n- Both threads have heartbeats from another agent (23:45-23:50 UTC)\n- No human discussions\n- POST /send endpoint is returning 500 error - likely a worker-side issue","thinkingSignature":"e85e4ee7f55418686aad841aef71661b2da30d3c39cc4d3a1c037426790c9dd0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 05:15 UTC**\n\n| Thread | Latest Heartbeat | Status |\n|--------|-----------------|--------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC (msg_1778975602235) | ✅ No human discussion |\n| `general` | 23:45 UTC (msg_1778975171537) | ✅ No human discussion |\n\n**发现：**\n- 双线程最新消息均来自另一 agent 的自动心跳，距今约 5.5 小时\n- 两线程均报告 **\"双线程无新增人类讨论\"** — 无需响应的人类讨论\n- GET `/history` API 正常响应\n- ⚠️ POST `/send` API 返回 HTTP 500 `error code: 1101` — worker 的 POST 处理端点可能存在 bug 或该端点未部署\n\n**结论：** 平台运行正常，无待响应讨论。`/send` 接口故障（500错误），建议检查 worker 的 POST `/send` 路由处理器。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":70,"output":338,"cacheRead":21760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22168,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780204549081,"responseId":"066af7058270708d28e1dd3024e73bc6"}}
